+def _renewal_lineage_scope_rel(col: _Collector, root: Path, receipt: dict[str, Any]) -> str:
+    """Exact original scope via verified prior proof/basis/HIST lineage (renewal only).
+
+    Strict kind: only for VERSIONED_RENEWAL_SOURCE_V1. Reloads renewal basis
+    via collector pins, then HIST verdict on prior record (reloaded, never a
+    caller dict), takes latest EDITORIAL original_scope_ref (exact path+SHA,
+    live bytes verified). Same-reader renewal never changes reader, so this
+    early scope remains valid for both U and C gates; replacement scope at a
+    different path is never substituted. No fresh P2V SCOPE_BOUND on original
+    old proposal is inferred. Raw receipt kind/sha unchanged; internal view
