+# ROOT FULL 0425c530 S5, R4 row33. Retention/staged/current-authority validators take
+# explicit R4 + PREARCH wrapper refs post-adoption (no canonical fallback). Human
+# approval refs NEVER rebound. Family: verify_retention/materialize_staged/
+# current_authority/publication_approval. READY entry+prepublish on capture;
+# verify_* diagnostic MUST NOT require guard absence but is NOT a write permit.
+# Research own lineage distinct from publication supersedes.
