+    and rechecks pinned bytes after the call. Resolves the prior versioned
+    history via the typed historian and records current tool predicates as
+    INFO pins only (never compared to state.contract here; that equality lives
+    in the forbidden production.verify_state_basis). Returns invocation-local
+    pins only; no public verified-object parameter. NEVER calls
