+  - frozen 731 snapshot files (stable base, not live candidate-work)
+  - ONLY own fixed source file overlaid (parallel-disjoint ownership)
+then SOURCE-only commit (source paths only, E stays untracked) BEFORE any
+authority. Old tool ancestry retained via 721a04d parent. No execution of
+changed candidate-work directly; all imports from fixture work only.
+
+F1: pinned-vs-fresh reverify (not fresh-vs-fresh). Seam swaps bytes between
+    initial check and final reverify -> BASIS_DIGEST_MISMATCH, no writes, repair.
+F2: Discovery JSONL FD-bound sess + SHA pin + pinned parse (no second open).
+    Seam swaps JSONL after acceptance validation (shape-valid) -> hash pin fails.
+F3: Layer-B CURRENT git-anchored (own root/HEAD, ancestor+control, 100644,
+    artifact-only PASS, control/dirty/staged/untracked/mode/missing/wrong-root
+    refusal). No HEAD==epoch blind requirement. No global cache, fresh every call.
