+    # with NEW durable copies (fresh VALIDATED_DRAFT/VERSIONED_ACTIVE, TinyTeX from start).
+    # Provider callable (kind)->Path takes precedence if supplied. Legacy default preserved
+    # when env/provider absent (old bootstrap-weekly/longform, 2026-W37/wk-boot-1).
+    # No old /tmp dangling paths; durable paths are absolute validated copies.
+    if provider is not None:
